<title>USA: Market Guide Inc Q2 net income falls.</title>
<headline>Market Guide Inc Q2 net income falls.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE SUCCESS, N.Y. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the three months ended  For the six months ended</p>
<p>			 Aug 31,    Aug 31,	Aug 31,    Aug 31,</p>
<p>			    1996	1995	   1996	 1995</p>
<p> Revenues	 $1,117,148   $970,580   $2,248,254 $1,860,921</p>
<p> Net Income	   37,442    101,552	175,153    178,606</p>
<p>Earnings per Share:</p>
<p>  Primary		  .01	  .02	    .04	  .04</p>
<p>  Fully Diluted	  .01	  .02	    .04	  .04</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares</p>
<p>Outstanding:</p>
<p>  Primary	  4,192,088  4,174,470    4,190,167  4,145,603</p>
<p>  Fully Diluted  4,375,517  4,409,170    4,373,596  4,393,187</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said that the Q2 earnings decrease was due to the reduction in Investext revenues as well as the opening of Market Guide sales office in Chicago.</p>
